key.description:
Structure: {
    "app-id": {
        "title": "App Name",
        "custom_title": "User override",
        "custom_icon": "icon-name or absolute path",
        "detected_icon": "...",
        "icon_theme_path": "...",
        "cached_icon_path": "...",
        "is_hidden": false,
        "priority": 0
    }
}

Drives last-writer-wins merging on pull so no host loses an app
entry and a forget propagates. Structure: {
    "entries": { "app-id": { "m": 0, "h": "hash" } },
    "tombstones": { "app-id": 0 }
}
